[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14700.63, "timestamp": "04:05:00", "text": "因为是私有财产，所以我就保持原样了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14703.59, "timestamp": "04:05:03", "text": "然后放弃了。你们给我打电话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14705.67, "timestamp": "04:05:05", "text": "告诉我我有可能获得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14708.229, "timestamp": "04:05:08", "text": "工作和一切。我准备好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14711.83, "timestamp": "04:05:11", "text": "就像，当我看到 Razer Pay 的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14713.83, "timestamp": "04:05:13", "text": "不允许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14716.469, "timestamp": "04:05:16", "text": "呃，目前是太阳能所有权"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14720.07, "timestamp": "04:05:20", "text": "他们是私营企业，优先考虑有限责任公司 (LLC) 和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14722.63, "timestamp": "04:05:22", "text": "一切。于是我就在那里放弃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14725.269, "timestamp": "04:05:25", "text": "因为我不想把它变成有限责任公司。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14728.95, "timestamp": "04:05:28", "text": "那一刻。呃，还有你们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14732.63, "timestamp": "04:05:32", "text": "现在给我打电话，给了我希望。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14734.55, "timestamp": "04:05:34", "text": "一切我都能得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14737.269, "timestamp": "04:05:37", "text": "跑步什么的。对，就是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14739.429, "timestamp": "04:05:39", "text": "这就是我愿意努力解决的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14753.59, "timestamp": "04:05:53", "text": "是的。"}]